cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below and cite the accompanying article
  (Roberts et al., under review at Nature). The exact code used for the article is
  release v1.0.0, archived on Zenodo.
title: "ABCD Biopsychosocial Prediction: high-dimensional ensemble stacking ML pipeline"
type: software
abstract: >-
  High-dimensional ensemble stacking machine learning pipeline for hierarchical,
  interactive, and dynamic prediction of psychiatric, cognitive, and social outcomes
  in the ABCD Study. It compares the hierarchical, interactive, concurrent, and
  prospective predictive capacities of biological, psychological, social, and
  environmental measurement domains, within and across theoretically relevant
  measurement categories, for depression, anxiety, ADHD, the internalizing and
  externalizing spectra, and cognitive, educational, and social outcomes in
  adolescents and their parents.
